==Russian==

===Etymology===
Deverbal from {{m|ru|прики́нуть||to [[try on]]}}, based on the stem {{m|ru||прики́д-}}; compare imperfective {{m|ru|прики́дывать}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|прики́д}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|прики́д}}

# {{lb|ru|slang}} [[threads]], [[outfit]], [[clothing]], [[attire]]

====Usage notes====
This term was popular among [[hippie|hippies]] in the 1970s.

====Declension====
{{ru-noun-table|прики́д}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|ru|прики́дывать|g=impf}}, {{l|ru|прики́нуть|g=pf}}
* {{l|ru|прики́дываться|g=impf}}, {{l|ru|прики́нуться|g=pf}}
* {{l|ru|прики́дка}}
